/// How the process obtains a secret. Never the secret itself, except Static.
///
/// One-of-many pattern: an abstract module declares the shape and a fixed
/// `type` discriminator; each implementation is its own module in this
/// directory that `extends` it. pkl-go generates a Go interface here and one
/// package per implementation.
///
/// `type` is fixed but not hidden so it survives pklbin/json/yaml.
@go.Package { name = "github.com/bmurray/alexandria/internal/gen/credential" }
abstract module alexandria.credential.Credential

import "@pkl.golang/go.pkl"

/// Discriminator. Each implementation fixes it.
fixed type: String
